{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Cut for Stories 是一款專為 Instagram Stories 設計的圖片編輯工具，讓你透過匯入圖片、套用模板、加入多段文字與特效，輕鬆製作出更具個人風格的限時動態。目前限時免費，原價 US $0.99，適合喜歡裝飾 Story、希望快速分享精彩時刻的用戶。</p>\n\n<h2>Story 創作功能</h2>\n<p>這款 App 提供多款 Story 模板，可自由擺放圖片並製作即影即有、舊相機等效果；同時具備亮度、對比度調整、自訂漸變背景、取色器、多款字型與多段文字輸入，亦能快速裁剪圖片並加入模糊或彩色背景，可一鍵儲存或直接分享到 Instagram Story。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1151-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1152-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1153-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1154-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1155-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1156-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cut for Stories</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T04:20:44.483467+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}